---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="How Mindtivate handles your data.">
  <section class="section container prose-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p><em>Last updated: August 2026.</em></p>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>
      If you subscribe to our newsletter, we collect the email address you
      provide. Newsletter signups are processed by our email provider,
      Sender (sender.net), which handles delivery, list management, and
      unsubscribes on our behalf. We do not sell or rent your email address.
    </p>
    <p>
      This site may also collect standard, aggregated analytics (such as
      page views) to understand what content is useful. We do not use this
      data to identify individual visitors.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>
      This site avoids unnecessary tracking cookies. Any analytics or
      embedded content (such as a Pinterest widget) may set its own cookies
      under that provider's respective privacy policy.
    </p>

    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>
      You can unsubscribe from the newsletter at any time using the link in
      any email we send. To request deletion of your data, <a href="/contact">contact us</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
    <p>
      Some outbound links on this site are affiliate links. See our
      <a href="/affiliate-disclosure">affiliate disclosure</a> for details.
      We do not control the privacy practices of third-party sites you
      navigate to.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>
      We may update this policy from time to time. Material changes will be
      reflected by updating the date at the top of this page.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .prose-page {
    max-width: 720px;
  }
</style>
